{
 "0": [
  {
   "text": "You're crossing a beach at low tide...",
   "t": 0.323
  },
  {
   "text": "and your legs sink into the sand.",
   "t": 2.089
  }
 ],
 "1": [
  {
   "text": "It's quicksand.",
   "t": 4.328
  },
  {
   "text": "And it won't let go.",
   "t": 5.732
  }
 ],
 "2": [
  {
   "text": "Your instinct says yank your leg out.",
   "t": 8.083
  },
  {
   "text": "Don't.",
   "t": 10.252
  },
  {
   "text": "Pulling one foot out fast takes about as much force as lifting a car.",
   "t": 11.128
  }
 ],
 "3": [
  {
   "text": "And don't let a friend haul you out either.",
   "t": 15.551
  },
  {
   "text": "The sand holds on so hard,",
   "t": 17.912
  },
  {
   "text": "they could badly hurt you.",
   "t": 19.339
  }
 ],
 "4": [
  {
   "text": "Here's what the movies get wrong: you can't sink all the way under.",
   "t": 21.243
  },
  {
   "text": "Quicksand is about twice as dense as your body,",
   "t": 23.139
  },
  {
   "text": "so you float,",
   "t": 25.171
  },
  {
   "text": "roughly waist deep.",
   "t": 28.563
  }
 ],
 "5": [
  {
   "text": "So the sand isn't what kills you.",
   "t": 30.208
  },
  {
   "text": "On a beach...",
   "t": 32.643
  },
  {
   "text": "the tide is.",
   "t": 33.768
  }
 ],
 "6": [
  {
   "text": "The move: stop struggling.",
   "t": 35.44
  },
  {
   "text": "Wiggle your legs slowly,",
   "t": 36.25
  },
  {
   "text": "in small circles.",
   "t": 37.572
  },
  {
   "text": "That lets water seep in and loosens the sand around you.",
   "t": 40.301
  }
 ],
 "7": [
  {
   "text": "Then lean back,",
   "t": 43.629
  },
  {
   "text": "spread your arms,",
   "t": 44.591
  },
  {
   "text": "and let your body float on top.",
   "t": 45.681
  },
  {
   "text": "Inch by inch,",
   "t": 47.669
  },
  {
   "text": "work your way to firm ground.",
   "t": 48.502
  }
 ],
 "8": [
  {
   "text": "So...",
   "t": 50.962
  },
  {
   "text": "would you have kept pulling,",
   "t": 51.334
  },
  {
   "text": "or leaned back?",
   "t": 53.42
  }
 ]
}